==English==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|la|geminātus}}, perfect passive participle of {{m|la|geminō||to double}}.

===Pronunciation===
; Adjective
* {{a|UK|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˈdʒɛmɪnət/}}
** {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-geminate (adj).wav|Audio (UK)}}
; Verb
